Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Imagine because\Nyou're so obsessed,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.30,0:00:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,you don't know\Nanything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.50,0:00:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So from morning to\Nnight,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.65,0:00:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,you're training for\Nyourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.80,0:00:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,After going home,\Nyou're watching
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.80,0:00:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,for entertainment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.25,0:00:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael Jordan play.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.10,0:00:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what my\Nwife
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.93,0:00:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,says, you play\Nfootball the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.77,0:00:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,whole day and you\Ncome
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.60,0:00:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,back and then watch\Nfootball
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.43,0:00:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,again. What is wrong\Nwith
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.27,0:00:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.60,0:00:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And but that's what\Nit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.42,0:00:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.25,0:00:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's what the\Nobsession
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.17,0:00:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,does to you.
